module Core

### Represents the protocol for modulo-width addition.
### `WrappingAddable` is for bounded bit-width types whose addition surface
### discards overflow bits instead of trapping or clamping.
protocol WrappingAddable
  ### Returns the wrapping sum of this value and `you`.
  ### The result is reduced to the bit width of the conforming type.
  ### :param you: The other value to add.
  ### :returns: The resulting `Me` value.
  @readonly
  routine Me.$add_wrap(you: Me) -> ?Me
